cc0d380b-434d-4b4d-93c9-5746cd037020,2026-01-30T09:11:20.214179,Reddit_Style,26282ab6-735a-43b7-8499-75dcd543d16d,"Hey fellow Redditors, has anyone else noticed some sketchy stuff happening with their Mashreq accounts lately? I woke up to find two unauthorized transactions on my account statement and, from what I can tell, I’m not the only one. I’m super careful with my online banking info—like, I don’t even save my password on my phone—but somehow these charges slipped through. 

