fa053917-1659-4565-bef7-762e590343f0,2026-01-30T01:35:26.829334,Reddit_Style,1cbab73f-4b54-4afc-bba9-833030731368,"Anyone else experiencing painfully slow transaction processing with MashreqBank lately? Been trying to make a simple transfer for over 4 hours, and each time the app just stalls at the confirmation page. It's frustrating because I rely on timely transfers for my freelance work and this is really affecting my schedule. 

