ac6d4bf9-283e-4d48-9640-f4611c608a58,2026-01-29T14:13:53.823911,Reddit_Style,b2debf74-6996-4bcc-970d-3d4acc1c9782,"Has anyone else in Dubai noticed that Mashreq's banking app has been kind of laggy lately? I've been a loyal customer for a while, but honestly, I've been hearing a lot of buzz about how the competitor apps are really raising the bar. I tried out an app from one of those newer digital banks, and the user experience is just on another level - everything is so seamless. With Mashreq, it feels like I'm constantly hitting snags every time I attempt a transaction, especially with the mobile app timing out or freezing. 

