9900d401-f687-44dd-9802-3edfacb561d9,2026-01-29T02:21:47.324429,Reddit_Style,614f4ed1-212a-4712-ad04-773c05b8c04e,"Has anyone heard the rumor about a possible data breach at Mashreq? I know there’s been a lot of speculation online, but I've noticed some unusual activity in my account and support has been super vague when I reached out. It’s making me really anxious, especially after reading about similar issues with other banks recently. 

