8a16c607-d958-4c69-8e0e-4fd41262a16c,2026-01-28T22:24:49.469157,LinkedIn_Style,e304c256-bb3b-4928-9753-7967dcc553ba,"Today was a tough reminder of our reliance on digital banking. I woke up eager to transfer some funds for an urgent transaction, only to find myself locked out of my Mashreq account. After multiple failed logins, I felt a wave of desperation. In a fast-paced world, being unable to access your own money can be incredibly unsettling. 

