6433bd07-e527-4653-a4e2-acd35ccd4a3c,2026-01-28T18:06:56.088601,LinkedIn_Style,42371518-ca47-42ee-827f-cc4bbb57a892,"Today, I encountered a rather alarming situation that I believe serves as a crucial reminder for all of us navigating the digital banking world in the UAE. I received an SMS that claimed to be from Mashreq, insisting that there was an urgent issue with my account. The message provided a link and requested immediate action to 'secure' my details. Having attended several cybersecurity seminars, my alarm bells immediately went off. 

