cd967074-77f3-442a-b91c-cd85143d8fb8,2026-01-28T17:16:38.160042,LinkedIn_Style,ff67e05c-03cd-42c8-89bb-b10ec99fb03b,"Today was a wake-up call regarding digital banking security. I received an unexpected call from someone claiming to be a representative from Mashreq, very convincing at first—polite and knowledgeable. They asked for personal details, citing ""security updates"" due to ""new regulatory changes."" It wasn't until they pressed for my full PIN that I realized this was a social engineering scam. I've always emphasized vigilance to my team, but experiencing it firsthand was different. Remember, @MashreqBank will never ask for your PIN or password over the phone. Stay alert and protect your information. It's alarming how sophisticated these fraudsters have become. Let's spread awareness and ensure this doesn’t happen to others. #DigitalBankingSecurity #StaySafe",,cd967074-77f3-442a-b91c-cd85143d8fb8,None,en,"[""DigitalBankingSecurity"", ""StaySafe""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.36,False,62
