99571e50-502d-45bc-bfe1-e9ead7a675f7,2026-01-28T03:16:46.676435,LinkedIn_Style,aa39e5f3-25be-4d52-af65-2010e4d1c7c4,"Today was quite an eye-opener for me as we navigate the ever-evolving landscape of digital banking. Experiencing a service outage at Mashreq made me ponder on our reliance on seamless payment systems. Imagine standing at the checkout with a cart full of groceries, only to face payment failures. Not the ideal scenario, especially in a fast-paced city like Dubai. Customer service was inundated, and while I eventually managed to resolve it, it got me thinking about our contingency plans. As we push towards a cashless society, it's critical to have backup solutions and maybe even consider carrying a little cash. I'd like to hear from the community - what are your experiences and solutions in similar situations?",,99571e50-502d-45bc-bfe1-e9ead7a675f7,Image,en,"[""#digitalbanking"", ""#customerexperience"", ""#UAE""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.54,False,50
d69407dc-7a15-49e9-89aa-a9662083870c,2026-01-28T03:11:29.712914,LinkedIn_Style,1d03982f-7e87-47c6-8665-cb5bd3274532,"Today reminded me why vigilance is crucial in digital banking. Received a suspicious call from someone claiming to be @MashreqBank, asking for my OTP to 'verify a transaction'. Instantly felt wrong. Mashreq would never ask for this info over the phone! It's alarming how sophisticated these fraud attempts are becoming. For everyone out there, please stay alert and NEVER share your OTP or PIN, no matter how convincing they sound. We need to maintain our trust in digital banking by fostering a community of awareness. Spread the word and let's safeguard our financial well-being. #StaySafe #DigitalSecurity",,d69407dc-7a15-49e9-89aa-a9662083870c,None,en,"[""#StaySafe"", ""#DigitalSecurity"", ""#PhishingAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.44,False,54
5ba5c502-636d-441c-ae4e-4a7e3a6a870f,2026-01-28T03:09:26.821457,LinkedIn_Style,719c0654-664a-4de1-ba56-63f713e75e0b,"Today was a tough day in the world of digital banking. I initiated a fund transfer through Mashreq thinking it would be the usual seamless experience. Unfortunately, the transfer got stuck in the 'pending' status for hours, which disrupted my entire schedule. It reminded me of how much we rely on smooth digital transactions in our daily lives as expats here in the UAE. 

