9449e94a-6751-4370-b1a0-af80a1c5636d,2026-01-27T22:38:13.646924,Reddit_Style,614f4ed1-212a-4712-ad04-773c05b8c04e,"So I’ve been a loyal @MashreqBank customer for years, but lately, I'm starting to notice some interesting moves from other banks in the UAE. I mean, have you guys seen the cashback offers that Emirates NBD and ADCB are rolling out? They’re pretty tempting, to be honest. 

