0bdacc81-4418-4043-a4c6-626da374a280,2026-01-27T05:34:21.236610,LinkedIn_Style,9143bbe1-468a-4f21-b561-67767f229afb,"Navigating the digital banking world can sometimes feel like walking through a minefield. Today, I learned that vigilance is key after receiving a call from someone pretending to be from Mashreq. They were so convincing, asking for personal information to 'secure my account'. It was only a deep sense of skepticism that stopped me from falling for it. The caller knew details about my recent transactions, which highlighted just how sophisticated these scams have become. In a time where digital banking is essential, we need to be aware of social engineering tactics targeting us. It's essential to educate ourselves and others. Always verify the source before sharing any personal information. Mashreq has robust security measures, but we must all play our part in keeping our accounts safe. Stay alert, and don't hesitate to contact your bank directly through official channels if you're ever in doubt. Together, we can create a more secure banking environment.",,0bdacc81-4418-4043-a4c6-626da374a280,Image,en,"[""#DigitalSafety"", ""#BankingFraud"", ""#StayAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.71,False,67
