Thanks for any input. Stay safe, everyone!",,170e14a9-9ab6-4c51-870a-f698217bf3a9,None,en,"[""#MashreqBank"", ""#IdentityTheft"", ""#FraudAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.46,False,72
