61a2ed5e-97d7-4dff-862b-fa0a43a4f171,2026-01-26T21:37:17.140220,LinkedIn_Style,d0e44cb2-efb3-4b74-8428-0ccbf012868f,"Today was an eye-opener regarding digital banking security. I almost fell for a phishing scam from someone claiming to be with Mashreq. They asked for my OTP, insisting there was a problem with my account. Thankfully, I remembered that banks never ask for PINs or OTPs. This experience highlighted the importance of staying vigilant. Phishing tactics are getting increasingly sophisticated, targeting even the most tech-savvy among us. If you receive a suspicious call, hang up and directly contact your bank using the number on their official website. Don’t let fear cloud your judgment—always verify before you act. Educating ourselves and spreading awareness is crucial. Let's protect ourselves and others in our network by sharing these experiences. Stay safe, everyone!",,61a2ed5e-97d7-4dff-862b-fa0a43a4f171,Image,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#ScamAlert"", ""#StaySafe""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.54,False,85
