24676c80-2da5-4efe-a67a-daca709eefef,2026-01-26T21:34:31.230746,Reddit_Style,b8b22d7c-1dd0-4a9c-8ee1-95d4bf6de2e1,"Has anyone else been getting weird OTP requests for transactions they didn't initiate? I got like 5 OTP messages from @MashreqBank today and I haven't even logged into my account. What's even more worrying is that a friend mentioned something similar happening to them. Are we looking at a phishing scam targeting Mashreq customers? 

