a2d02f96-bc62-44a1-b21f-02dd355f5872,2026-01-26T20:39:55.928817,LinkedIn_Style,b10e276e-c9ed-4830-9ee2-67dc1805f23d,"Today was a wake-up call on how sophisticated social engineering attacks have become. I received a phone call from someone claiming to be from @MashreqBank, asking for personal banking details due to a supposed 'suspicious activity' alert. The caller had my full name and even recent transaction details! Thankfully, I was aware that banks never ask for sensitive information over the phone. It's a reminder of the importance of vigilance and always questioning unexpected requests. Let's stay informed and protect ourselves against these threats. If you experience anything similar, ensure to verify directly with the bank through official contact numbers. Awareness is our first line of defense against fraud.",,a2d02f96-bc62-44a1-b21f-02dd355f5872,Image,en,"[""#DigitalSecurity"", ""#BankingFraud"", ""#MashreqBank"", ""#StaySafe""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.39,False,75
