03d8590c-40e5-4297-af7e-c193b83bb524,2026-01-26T15:42:22.438138,Reddit_Style,b17f181b-f7a4-41e4-8917-13b791d1979f,"Hey fellow expats! I've been using MashreqBank's credit card for a while now and have to share how surprisingly good their rewards program has been. Last month, I managed to redeem points for a free night at a pretty nice hotel in Dubai. 💼🏨 It's mostly because they offer double points on dining and groceries. I mean, we all eat out so often, it's like we're getting freebies for just living normally. 

