ff5f511c-9d54-488d-8a34-27c23e71685e,2026-01-26T15:40:37.910367,LinkedIn_Style,bd63c7c6-f643-4d06-9084-db39b779a63d,"Today I encountered a concerning issue that every digital banking user should be aware of. I received a seemingly legitimate call, with the caller claiming to be from Mashreq, urgently requesting my OTP for 'security verification'. Immediately, red flags went off. In this digital age, safeguarding our banking information is more crucial than ever. Remember, no legitimate bank will ever ask for your OTP or PIN under any circumstances. It’s time we all become more vigilant and educate ourselves on spotting these scams. Don't let your guard down, and if in doubt, always verify directly with your bank using official contact methods. Stay safe, everyone.",,ff5f511c-9d54-488d-8a34-27c23e71685e,None,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#PhishingScam"", ""#StaySafe"", ""#Mashreq""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.62,False,100
