8edbb7f4-621d-4419-a335-ec025448dc04,2026-01-26T15:35:09.512272,Reddit_Style,b2debf74-6996-4bcc-970d-3d4acc1c9782,"Anyone else facing issues with Mashreq's online banking? I can't log into my account for the past 5 hours. Keeps saying 'service unavailable'. Tried calling customer support but the lines are jammed. This isn't the first time this is happening, and it's starting to make me question the reliability of this bank. Given that it's a weekend, this is incredibly frustrating. Could this be some kind of major system outage? Or is it just a glitch? In any case, it's making it impossible to access funds when I need them the most. Anyone got any updates or workarounds? Maybe try reinstalling the app? Interested to hear if this is a widespread issue or just bad luck on my end. #DubaiLife",,8edbb7f4-621d-4419-a335-ec025448dc04,None,en,"[""#MashreqIssues"", ""#BankingWoes"", ""#DubaiLife""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.81,False,67
c7122775-b4c8-459e-877b-431d0f03002f,2026-01-26T15:34:53.753804,LinkedIn_Style,8b62da0e-8616-4cf0-af38-ce1d301166a3,"Today, I experienced a new level of deception in the world of digital banking. Got a call from someone claiming to be from MashreqBank, asking me to verify my account details due to suspicious activity. It felt off. 

