d5dcfe56-cb4a-48a4-a124-44086403afd0,2026-01-26T14:16:22.348873,LinkedIn_Style,c4a0ee31-efc3-4f03-8dfb-986d9c58ea4f,"In the fast-paced world of finance, it's the little conveniences that make the biggest difference. Recently, I had to make a cross-border transfer and to be honest, I was a bit anxious after hearing stories about delays and complications with international transactions. To my surprise, @MashreqBank made it incredibly easy and straightforward. The funds were transferred seamlessly within the promised timeframe, and I received notifications at every stage of the process. It's experiences like these that restore my faith in digital banking and keep me loyal to Mashreq. Hats off to their team for ensuring such a smooth customer experience. If you're in the UAE and looking for reliable banking service, Mashreq is worth considering.",,d5dcfe56-cb4a-48a4-a124-44086403afd0,Video_Link,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#CustomerExperience"", ""#Mashreq""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Positive_Neutral,0.67,False,24
b5848fdd-b85e-44dc-9834-e1f1ab3cd29d,2026-01-26T14:15:38.217367,Reddit_Style,fcfeb0b5-5783-45d1-a5ab-91c87148a96a,"I've been with Mashreq for a couple of years and I mostly like them, but has anyone else checked out the new loan approval process at RAKBANK? A friend mentioned they applied for a personal loan and got approval within 24 hours. With Mashreq, I've experienced waiting for several days, sometimes a week, just to hear back about initial approval. 

