e4aacad4-e945-45a7-9c2d-1941af5a5e83,2026-01-26T14:03:30.543887,LinkedIn_Style,3850790e-ee22-42f6-ad06-b0d3da41d44d,"Today, I encountered a potential scam targeting Mashreq customers that highlights the importance of vigilance in digital banking. I received a call from someone claiming to be from Mashreq, saying there was an urgent issue with my account that required my OTP for verification. My instincts kicked in immediately - never share your OTP or PIN over the phone, even if the caller sounds official. These phishing scams are getting more sophisticated every day. It's crucial for all of us in the banking industry to spread awareness and educate ourselves and others about such threats. Remember, @MashreqBank will never ask for your OTP or PIN over a phone call. Let's stay aware and keep our information secure. #DigitalBankingSecurity #StaySafe #BankingFraudAlert",,e4aacad4-e945-45a7-9c2d-1941af5a5e83,None,en,"[""DigitalBankingSecurity"", ""StaySafe"", ""BankingFraudAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.3,False,100
