5c63c4c0-d133-4c7b-aa8d-bbfaffb09f6f,2026-01-26T11:18:51.228059,LinkedIn_Style,01fd4afd-3050-4804-ba6a-9bdda8f99741,"Today I experienced a disconcerting issue that every digital banking user should be aware of. I received what initially seemed like a legitimate call from someone claiming to represent Mashreq. They had access to personal details that made the conversation seem genuine. But when they started asking for more sensitive information, including my OTP and card details, I knew something was off. It's a stark reminder of how sophisticated identity theft attempts have become. 

In a world where cyber threats are growing, reinforcing our commitment to digital security has never been more important. Always verify official communications through the bank's official channels before sharing any details. This incident has been a wake-up call, not just for me but for anyone who trusts digital platforms. Stay safe, stay informed. #DigitalSecurity #CyberAwareness",,5c63c4c0-d133-4c7b-aa8d-bbfaffb09f6f,Image,en,"[""#DigitalSecurity"", ""#CyberAwareness"", ""#IdentityTheft""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.93,False,53
