df358bcf-34cc-411f-8841-d16d4394e198,2026-01-26T10:07:45.410672,LinkedIn_Style,ac8112ea-6ae3-4151-916a-d716f52be754,"This weekend I experienced something quite insightful during my shopping spree that I wanted to share with my network. While eagerly hopping from one store to another in Dubai Mall, I came across some amazing offers that seemed too good to be true. Already thrilled, I decided to take a break and check my banking app. As I enjoyed my coffee and reviewed my expenses, an unexpected call came through. Claiming to be from @MashreqBank, the caller wanted to verify some 'suspicious activity'. Luckily, my experience in digital security allowed me to spot the red flags. Friends, always double-check before sharing any info over the phone. Remember, excitement can sometimes cloud our judgment, especially during sales season. Stay informed and shop wisely! #DigitalBanking #ShoppingSpree #StaySafe",,df358bcf-34cc-411f-8841-d16d4394e198,None,en,"[""DigitalBanking"", ""ShoppingSpree"", ""StaySafe""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Irrelevant,0.17,False,19
51518408-a19d-451c-896e-56146919c759,2026-01-26T10:06:23.860085,LinkedIn_Style,04ef8974-5305-4947-8d0f-d7fb04a1f275,"Today, as I navigated through the myriad of banking options in the UAE, I found myself reflecting on the reward programs offered by various banks. I've been with Mashreq for several years, and while their service is commendable, I can’t help but notice the more competitive reward schemes popping up from other institutions. I recently heard a fellow expat mention how she switched banks because another provider offered better cashback on everyday purchases. While @MashreqBank has a decent rewards system, especially beneficial for travel enthusiasts, I feel they could enhance their offerings to remain competitive in the evolving digital banking landscape. Banking professionals, what are your thoughts? How do you see reward programs influencing customer loyalty in this digital age?",,51518408-a19d-451c-896e-56146919c759,None,en,"[""#UAEbanking"", ""#CustomerLoyalty"", ""#RewardsPrograms""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Competitor_News,-0.01,False,27
