084ef7b1-59b0-4602-a985-94be8f59256b,2026-01-26T09:55:37.256075,LinkedIn_Style,2d9bbc5d-8831-477b-b35a-458e88b0a3bd,"Today has been quite an eye-opener for me concerning digital security. I received an unexpected call claiming to be from Mashreq, asking for sensitive info to 'verify my account'. It sounded off from the get-go. As someone who's been banking in the UAE for years, I've learned a few things about spotting scams. The caller knew details about my recent transactions, which was initially convincing, but the urgency in their voice was a major red flag. Remember, no legitimate bank will ask for your personal details or passwords over the phone. If you receive a similar call, hang up immediately and contact Mashreq directly using the number on their website. In today's digital age, identity theft is a real threat, and we need to stay vigilant. Let’s protect ourselves and share these experiences. Stay safe, everyone. #DigitalSecurity #BankingSafety #StayAlert",,084ef7b1-59b0-4602-a985-94be8f59256b,None,en,"[""DigitalSecurity"", ""BankingSafety"", ""StayAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.43,False,93
