5c7e5444-fc5f-42fb-865b-c16c8054e774,2026-01-26T09:11:33.724503,Reddit_Style,839e3a46-266c-4556-b4ae-0da33322e48f,"Hey everyone! I've been using the Mashreq app for a while now, and I gotta say, I'm really impressed with their new budgeting tool feature. As someone who's always on the go, it helps me keep track of my expenses in such an easy way. You just link your accounts, and it categorizes your spending automatically. It even gives you insights on where you're spending most, which has been a game-changer for managing my finances better. 

