8db93f15-15c5-4ccf-affb-2070c116f647,2026-01-26T06:17:33.453639,LinkedIn_Style,b10e276e-c9ed-4830-9ee2-67dc1805f23d,"Today, I had an eye-opening experience when I almost fell victim to a phishing scam involving Mashreq. It's a reminder of how sophisticated these scams are becoming. I received a call from someone claiming to be from @MashreqBank, saying there was unusual activity on my account and they needed my OTP to secure it. Thankfully, a tiny voice in my head screamed 'No!'. Never share your OTP or PIN over the phone, no matter how convincing they sound. It was a close call and quite frankly, a frightening one. Cybersecurity is not just a tech issue; it's a personal one that requires vigilance. It's shocking how easy it is for scammers to manipulate and exploit our trust. Always verify directly with the bank if you receive any suspicious calls or messages. Stay alert and let's protect ourselves and our hard-earned money. #DigitalSecurity #FraudAwareness",71fbae71-882e-459b-a31f-7e0d00e014cc,483ea362-aef6-40f4-8ab9-a271b18e6a82,None,en,"[""DigitalSecurity"", ""FraudAwareness""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.58,False,96
