dc287215-b7e3-413f-9873-dd419072da7d,2026-01-26T05:48:57.067105,LinkedIn_Style,b10e276e-c9ed-4830-9ee2-67dc1805f23d,"Just experienced a rather unsettling incident that reinforces the importance of vigilance in our digital banking activities. I received an unexpected call this morning from someone claiming to be from Mashreq. The person on the other line had a very convincing pitch, knew personal details, and urgently requested sensitive information. Thankfully, I've read about these scams before and didn't fall for it. I immediately contacted MashreqBank directly to report this. As we increasingly rely on digital services, it's crucial to double-check any unsolicited requests and never share personal banking details over the phone. This incident is a stark reminder of the evolving tactics fraudsters are using to compromise our security. Stay alert and always verify the source before you react. Let's protect each other by sharing experiences and tips. Has anyone else encountered something similar? #DigitalSecurity #BankingFraudAwareness",,dc287215-b7e3-413f-9873-dd419072da7d,None,en,"[""DigitalSecurity"", ""BankingFraudAwareness""]",[],Fraud_Rumor,-0.44,False,82
