7a9dfceb-34e5-4f5c-bdaf-b5dc3ef7a0b7,2026-01-26T00:35:26.832173,LinkedIn_Style,0354ab36-f9c8-42e2-862e-c9de59d22cb1,"Just experienced the new feature by MashreqBank that allows for instant international transfers, and I must say, it’s a game-changer! As someone who frequently sends money back home, the usual waiting periods were always a concern. But this time, the transaction was completed seamlessly and instantly. It’s reassuring to see how Mashreq is prioritizing customer experience by integrating technology that genuinely saves time and stress. For anyone who is still struggling with traditional transfer routes, I recommend giving this a try. It’s innovations like these that reaffirm my choice to bank with Mashreq. Kudos to their team for staying ahead in the digital banking space!",,7a9dfceb-34e5-4f5c-bdaf-b5dc3ef7a0b7,None,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#Mashreq"", ""#FinTech"", ""#UAE""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Positive_Neutral,0.93,False,38
20478657-4059-4312-ade5-7afbf14d287d,2026-01-26T00:31:16.633282,LinkedIn_Style,2b63fb11-b504-49e5-9520-d465642d331e,"Reflecting on the current digital landscape, it's clear how reliant we've become on seamless banking experiences. Today was a stark reminder of the importance of contingency planning. Imagine logging into Mashreq's app for a crucial transaction, only to find out it’s not loading. The app is down والله تعبنا! As we increasingly depend on digital platforms for personal and business transactions, this outage not only disrupts our personal lives but also has a ripple effect on our professional responsibilities. It's a lesson in digital dependency and the need for robust backup plans. Securing alternative banking methods and maintaining direct contact with bank representatives can help mitigate these disruptions. Businesses should also consider investing in customer service that adapts quickly in such situations. Here's hoping @MashreqBank resolves the issue swiftly. Stay resilient, everyone!",,20478657-4059-4312-ade5-7afbf14d287d,Video_Link,mix,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#ServiceOutage"", ""#MashreqBank"", ""#Resilience""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.77,False,69
