260d347a-87c5-40bf-b1a9-a5ca1adddcd2,2026-01-26T00:25:07.830609,LinkedIn_Style,0f997e0f-a0f4-4e6d-8278-32bb678afb5f,"Reflecting on the incredible atmosphere at the Dubai 7s this past weekend. It's always fascinating to see how sports bring communities together here in the UAE. The energy was contagious, and it's a reminder of the significant roles brands like Mashreq play in supporting such events. Though not directly related, the sporting spirit resonates with our goal to foster community through innovation and service. While enjoying the games, I couldn't help but think about how MashreqBank is working to ensure that our digital experiences match the dynamic, inclusive energy of events like these. A few ideas come to mind about how to further engage our audience during such events, and I'm excited to see what's possible in the future. Any thoughts on how financial institutions can better integrate into these community experiences? Would love to hear your ideas.",,260d347a-87c5-40bf-b1a9-a5ca1adddcd2,None,en,"[""#Dubai7s"", ""#CommunityBanking"", ""#SportsAndFinance""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Irrelevant,-0.01,False,29
875818c0-3fbc-428c-b2d2-8b57ec4d9aa2,2026-01-26T00:24:41.897637,LinkedIn_Style,90f9c0ad-34b2-4b48-8368-d1b4119374d3,"A situation many of us expats fear happened to a colleague today. She got a call from someone claiming to be from @MashreqBank staff, asking for her personal info to 'prevent fraudulent transactions'. Thankfully, she was cautious and didn't share any details. Sharing this as a reminder to never disclose sensitive information over the phone. It's a good practice to hang up and call the bank directly through their official numbers if you're suspicious. Identity theft is real, and we need to stay vigilant. MashreqBank usually sends security alerts via their app, always double-check from trusted sources. Let’s protect ourselves and keep our banking data secure.",,875818c0-3fbc-428c-b2d2-8b57ec4d9aa2,None,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#FraudAlert"", ""#StaySafe"", ""#UAE""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.88,False,79
025cf1db-efda-4a52-94e8-fe6e83095979,2026-01-26T00:19:56.502498,Reddit_Style,1663024e-0e39-4c0c-8bf5-7a5194a455a6,الشباب، حد منكم فتح حساب مع @MashreqBank مؤخراً؟ أنا سويت فتح حساب أونلاين وما صدقت كيف كانت السالفة سهلة. كل شيء سار بسرعة وما احتجت أزور الفرع ولا شي! كانوا بعد مرنين في طلباتهم، يعني كملت كل الإجراءات من البيت وبسرعة ما توقعتها. بعد سمعت انه في عروض كوول حق الحسابات الجديدة، ف فكرت اشاركم تجربتي الرهيبة. حد لاحظ التغيير هذا في البنوك الثانية بعد، ولا بس عند مشرق؟,c187188d-1e74-4e6f-9b09-0da80e069fb7,c3c96b5b-69b6-41fc-a70b-3da7bb9e7fc2,None,ar,"[""#\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0642"", ""#\u0641\u062a\u062d_\u062d\u0633\u0627\u0628"", ""#\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0643\u0646\u0648\u0644\u0648\u062c\u064a\u0627""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Positive_Neutral,0.41,False,31
6cbe1589-d1ca-4bc0-bf2c-c6848e4fe919,2026-01-26T00:18:07.732999,LinkedIn_Style,1945e4c7-518f-4089-81c1-8cadf0b7d47e,"Sharing my experience to help others. Last week, I noticed a strange charge on my @MashreqBank credit card statement. I've read about card skimming incidents lately, and it reminded me how crucial it is to be vigilant. After some investigation, it was fortunately a false alarm, but the initial fear was real. Always check your statements carefully and immediately report any suspicious activity. Banks like Mashreq do have robust systems, but it's a collective effort from us all to stay safe. Also, be aware of skimming devices in public places and always cover your PIN. It's a good practice to regularly change your passwords and set up transaction alerts to catch fraud early. Stay safe, everyone! If it happened to me, it could happen to anyone. #DigitalBankingSecurity #Awareness",f6a12a18-c41c-4dc5-9767-bd912bca3bc6,483ea362-aef6-40f4-8ab9-a271b18e6a82,None,en,"[""#DigitalBankingSecurity"", ""#Awareness""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.42,False,65
