edd9b264-336b-4df7-910e-6170abde4e92,2026-01-26T00:02:36.218932,LinkedIn_Style,98c955d1-355e-4237-a94a-5609ad356d19,"I've always appreciated the strides Mashreq has made in digital banking, but today's experience was rather frustrating. Woke up to find that my salary wasn't credited. In a dynamic city like Dubai, where commitments are a part of daily life, delays can be really stressful. Reached out to @MashreqBank and it seems they're addressing a system outage that's affecting several accounts. Reminds me of the need for robust digital infrastructure and adequate contingency plans. It's a stark reminder of how dependent we've become on seamless tech solutions. Hopefully, this gets resolved soon. Meanwhile, it's a good reminder to always maintain an emergency fund. Anyone else facing similar issues today?",,edd9b264-336b-4df7-910e-6170abde4e92,None,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#TechOutage"", ""#UAE"", ""#CustomerExperience""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.58,False,72
03e69e44-c573-46ae-ba86-e3bf71ae7609,2026-01-26T00:01:40.074282,LinkedIn_Style,d08ecd25-1aaf-4553-98d4-68ac36149b3b,"This morning, I encountered a significant hiccup that many of us in the digital banking sphere fear—a service outage. I attempted to transfer a substantial amount through Mashreq's online portal, only to find my transaction stuck in limbo. In our fast-paced lives here in the UAE, every minute counts, and such disruptions can be both frustrating and costly. I reached out to their support and while their team is responsive, I can't help but feel the need for more robust systems. As digital banking continues to evolve, it's critical that our expectations for reliability are met. What are your thoughts on contingency plans for such outages? Perhaps it's time we consider diversifying our banking options or advocating for stronger tech resilience from our financial institutions. #DigitalBanking #UAE #ServiceOutage",,03e69e44-c573-46ae-ba86-e3bf71ae7609,None,en,"[""DigitalBanking"", ""UAE"", ""ServiceOutage""]",[],Service_Outage,-0.49,False,80
