cd190d3b-ae52-499a-9178-8c0042d2672f,2026-01-25T22:36:35.746249,Reddit_Style,f5ca1df9-1217-4981-b71b-78be7fa83b32,"Hey everyone, I'm getting seriously worried about what seems like a phishing attack targeting MashreqBank customers. Over the last few days, I've received multiple suspicious SMS messages claiming to be from @MashreqBank, saying there's an urgent issue with my account and providing a link to click on. They look super legit, but the URL is a bit off and I'm pretty sure it's a scam. Is anyone else experiencing this? 

