41fab0fe-2040-406f-8a27-bda6fedecf80,2026-01-25T10:47:50.494130,Reddit_Style,8b62da0e-8616-4cf0-af38-ce1d301166a3,يا جماعة، حد عنده فكرة شو اللي صاير مع @MashreqBank؟ اليوم جايتني رسالة عن OTP (الرقم السري) يقولون لازم أعطيهم عشان تحديث حسابي! 😳 يوم شكيت في الموضوع، سويت بحث وطلع إنه ممكن يكون احتيال! هو ممكن يكون صدق من البنك ولا في واحد قاعد يسرقنا؟ حد صار له هالموقف؟ لازم نكون حذرين ولا نسوي شي لين نتاكد. إللي خبره يفيدنا، مب عارف إذا فيه حد ثاني بيمر بهالمشكلة ولا بس أنا... شوي ودي أروح البنك وأسألهم بنفسي. #تحذير #احتيال #حماية_البيانات,,41fab0fe-2040-406f-8a27-bda6fedecf80,None,ar,"[""\u062a\u062d\u0630\u064a\u0631"", ""\u0627\u062d\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0644"", ""\u062d\u0645\u0627\u064a\u0629_\u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.82,False,59
50ff4c8a-bb25-444b-b489-774f159ce46c,2026-01-25T10:47:12.817763,LinkedIn_Style,dc63b5c9-eeb9-4256-a22d-2d02dd871279,"In today's digital age, it's more crucial than ever to stay vigilant. Earlier this week, I received what seemed like a legitimate call from someone claiming to be with Mashreq. They had a convincing story about 'suspicious activity' on my account and urgently needed my OTP to 'secure' it. Red flags all over! Remember, no bank will ever ask for your OTP or PIN over the phone or email. Sharing these details can lead to unauthorized access and potentially massive losses. Always verify the caller's identity if you’re unsure. Stay alert and protect yourself from these sophisticated phishing scams. We must all be aware and share such experiences to ensure others are not caught in the same trap. Let’s keep these fraudsters at bay! #CyberSecurity #StaySafe #MashreqBank",,50ff4c8a-bb25-444b-b489-774f159ce46c,None,en,"[""CyberSecurity"", ""StaySafe"", ""MashreqBank""]",[],Fraud_Rumor,-0.76,False,100
fcd1f56b-15f5-44de-8b78-bc5d881fc98b,2026-01-25T10:45:56.507915,LinkedIn_Style,fea9b34d-c6bc-473f-a268-7f967ae6912a,"Facing a digital dilemma this week: an unexpected security breach alert from Mashreq left me on edge. I received an email supposedly from MashreqBank asking to confirm my account details—definitely suspicious! 😟 With cyber fraud on the rise, it’s crucial to stay vigilant. If you receive unsolicited requests for personal info, contact your bank directly before responding. These threats are evolving, and an unwary moment can lead to disaster. Let’s keep our financial data secure and educate others about these deceptive tactics. Stay informed, stay safe. Has anyone else experienced similar issues with Mashreq recently? #DigitalSecurity #FraudAwareness",49e38fb3-00bc-4e32-b042-d777bb5dd95f,49e38fb3-00bc-4e32-b042-d777bb5dd95f,None,en,"[""DigitalSecurity"", ""FraudAwareness""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.92,False,66
8772211b-5e01-43f0-8da3-eee9a33ca545,2026-01-25T10:45:40.364825,LinkedIn_Style,f636e384-dc57-442b-8d71-cb546f182734,"Navigating the intricacies of digital banking greatly relies on trust and efficiency. Today, I confronted a real test of patience. Attempted a fund transfer via Mashreq, only to find it stuck in pending status. Called the helpline, spent almost an hour without a resolution. Such unpredictability can be unsettling, especially when supporting family across borders. It's crucial for @MashreqBank to enhance communication and expedite resolution processes during downturns. For fellow bankers and tech enthusiasts, this poses an interesting challenge: How can we use emerging tech to eliminate such bottlenecks? This is more than a service hiccup—it's a call to innovate and fortify digital infrastructures. Would love to hear thoughts from others who've faced similar issues. What solutions did you find effective?",,8772211b-5e01-43f0-8da3-eee9a33ca545,None,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#FinancialTech"", ""#Mashreq""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.41,False,41
452287d4-e005-4dd8-91e4-b76f4bbce7e2,2026-01-25T10:40:33.868293,LinkedIn_Style,be6aa0f0-a669-4f14-adb1-f023cdf5fc46,اليوم كنت في نقاش شيّق مع زميل عن برامج المكافآت في البنوك. والشي اللي لفت نظري فعلاً هو كيف بعض البنوك مثل @MashreqBank قاموا بتطوير برامجهم لتناسب احتياجات العملاء. سمعت أن بعض المنافسين يقدمون برامج بس فعلياً لما تشوف التفاصيل تلقاها مش بذيك الفائدة. الأهم بالنسبة لي هو الأشياء اللي أقدر أستفيد منها بشكل يومي، مثل الخصومات في المطاعم أو تطبيقات التوصيل. أحس إن المنافسة قوية واختيار البرنامج الصح يعتمد على احتياجاتك الخاصة، بس من تجربتي الشخصية، لازم الواحد يقرأ الشروط والأحكام بحذر عشان ما يتورط في برامج ما يستفيد منها بشكل فعلي. فعلاً شيء يخليني أفكر بكل قرار مصرفي بشكل استراتيجي!,,452287d4-e005-4dd8-91e4-b76f4bbce7e2,None,ar,"[""#\u0628\u0646\u0648\u0643"", ""#\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0645\u062c_\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0641\u0622\u062a"", ""#MashreqBank""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Competitor_News,-0.43,False,51
