9585bf59-743d-4922-b376-ca9f96dbf063,2026-01-25T08:13:29.519170,Reddit_Style,839e3a46-266c-4556-b4ae-0da33322e48f,"Hey all, just wondering if anyone else has noticed any changes with Mashreq's mobile app lately? I've been using it for routine transactions like utility bill payments and noticed that the interface seems to have been updated. Looks sleeker but I’m not sure if it’s just me or if something's a bit off. The transaction history doesn’t load sometimes. I tried switching between WiFi and mobile data but the problem persists. Has anyone else faced similar issues? Wondering if this is just an update bug or something bigger. It would be great to hear if others are having smoother experiences or if there’s something I should be doing differently.",,9585bf59-743d-4922-b376-ca9f96dbf063,None,en,"[""#MashreqBank"", ""#BankingApps"", ""#UAE""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Irrelevant,-0.16,False,12
e102ec5c-cf5c-4a63-9871-abb0982e4902,2026-01-25T08:09:01.187025,LinkedIn_Style,ba8dd3ea-2efd-470e-8397-57d0d8269df2,"In a rapidly evolving digital world, the onus is on us to stay vigilant. Today, I encountered a deceptive social engineering attempt targeting my banking details. A caller, claiming to be from Mashreq, asked for personal information under the guise of 'updating my account.' Instantly, I felt something was off—no bank should be asking for sensitive information out of the blue. This experience served as a stark reminder of the importance of verifying the identity of anyone asking for personal information. A simple call to Mashreq confirmed my suspicions—it was a fraud attempt. Remember, cybercriminals are becoming increasingly sophisticated, and we must remain one step ahead. If you receive such calls, hang up and contact your bank directly. Let's keep our finances safe and secure. #StayAlert #DigitalBankingSafety",,e102ec5c-cf5c-4a63-9871-abb0982e4902,None,en,"[""StayAlert"", ""DigitalBankingSafety""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.81,False,95
af974cea-0b30-4a04-a58c-9e0a957ab81b,2026-01-25T08:07:56.893891,LinkedIn_Style,8c4fc98a-bd70-4ca5-9dd1-1180839f94c2,من اليوم تعلمت إن لازم نكون جاهزين لأي شيء. تخيل صباحًا لما كنت أحاول أسوي تحويل مهم من خلال موقع Mashreq، اكتشفت إنه الموقع معطل! محبط جدًا خاصة لما تكون الأمور ضرورية وما عندك وقت. صراحة توقعت خدمة أفضل، خصوصًا من بنك مثل MashreqBank اللي معروف إنه من البنوك الرائدة في المنطقة. أتمنى الأمور تتحسن قريبًا ونشوف سرعة في الاستجابة من قبلهم. الوضع يذكرني بأهمية وجود خطة بديلة دومًا في مثل هالحالات. إذا كنتوا من عملاء البنك، انتبهوا دومًا وتابعوا تحديثاتهم.,,af974cea-0b30-4a04-a58c-9e0a957ab81b,Image,ar,"[""#\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0629_\u0639\u0645\u0644\u0627\u0621"", ""#Mashreq"", ""#\u0628\u0646\u0648\u0643""]",[],Service_Outage,-0.74,False,61
0acdadb4-11fc-4e73-9e7d-7a953d88ea06,2026-01-25T08:07:28.337428,LinkedIn_Style,6e8fa974-0d06-4d63-9585-d45b00e0a640,"Today has been incredibly frustrating. I had a major payment due for a supplier, but guess what? The @MashreqBank app is down again! We've been relying on digital banking to streamline operations, but these constant service interruptions are causing more harm than good. The app is down والله تعبنا! It's crucial for us as business professionals to have reliable banking solutions. Imagine the impact on SMEs who depend on every timely transaction. To @MashreqBank – we all understand tech issues can happen, but transparency and timely updates are key. Please address this before it impacts our business reputation further!",,0acdadb4-11fc-4e73-9e7d-7a953d88ea06,None,mix,"[""#MashreqBank"", ""#DigitalBanking"", ""#ServiceOutage"", ""#UAEbusiness""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.28,False,48
a2e4e882-a292-482d-886d-afbfb7da59c3,2026-01-25T08:07:10.576302,Reddit_Style,47366f81-808b-445d-b17a-7f4ae3502cf4,"Has anyone else been experiencing issues with Mashreq's website recently? I've been trying to access my account to pay some bills, but the site has been down for hours and keeps giving me error messages. I've tried different browsers and even checked on my phone with mobile data, but still no luck. It's getting really frustrating because I rely on their online services for most of my transactions. I've seen a few tweets about this too. Is this just a temporary glitch, or is there something bigger happening with their servers? Given the recent tech issues other banks have faced, I’m wondering if they are facing a similar situation. Love to hear from anyone else facing this and see if anyone got through to customer support, or if they had any insights into what’s going on. For now, thinking of reverting to the old school branch visit if this drags on much longer. #MashreqDown #UAEbanking",,a2e4e882-a292-482d-886d-afbfb7da59c3,None,en,"[""MashreqDown"", ""UAEbanking""]",[],Service_Outage,-0.22,False,65
