0d779590-6acf-459e-aa22-08ff7b892829,2026-01-25T04:01:35.228156,LinkedIn_Style,2b63fb11-b504-49e5-9520-d465642d331e,"In today's digital age, staying vigilant against banking scams is crucial. I recently had a concerning experience where someone posing as a representative from Mashreq tried to phish my OTP over a phone call. The caller was convincing, but there were tell-tale signs—like asking for my PIN and rushing me through the process. Remember, @MashreqBank and any legitimate bank will never ask for sensitive information over a call. Please be cautious and double-check any communication that seems out of the ordinary. Educate your teams and loved ones about the importance of safeguarding personal information. Let's work together to combat these scams and keep our financial data secure.",4da4f436-9ddf-4690-b858-898010875953,4da4f436-9ddf-4690-b858-898010875953,None,en,"[""#DigitalBanking"", ""#StaySafe"", ""#PhishingAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.82,False,95
