c73afff6-f980-42f0-8499-1f2039b09b62,2026-01-24T23:15:59.274114,LinkedIn_Style,25ca177a-1e64-4f3a-b054-5a9c99fccfa8,"An unsettling experience today and a critical lesson on digital banking security in the UAE. I received a very convincing call from someone claiming to be from @MashreqBank. They had detailed information about my account which made the call seem genuine at first. 😬 However, my gut feeling told me something was off when they started asking for my password to 'resolve a security issue.' Remember, no legitimate bank will ever ask you for such sensitive information over the phone! It was a close call, and it reinforced the importance of staying vigilant against social engineering attacks. I urge everyone to be cautious and double-check any unusual requests, no matter how convincing they may appear. Protecting our personal data is crucial, especially with how sophisticated these schemes are becoming. Stay safe and alert, everyone. #BankingSecurity #StaySafe #Vigilance",51cbd592-6ce3-48b3-9126-d5f9b4bd85f7,d2b4d7fd-8aac-4866-9a6d-de89677a5a23,None,en,"[""BankingSecurity"", ""StaySafe"", ""Vigilance""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.63,False,69
