5a158259-c906-42b5-9203-d7fafee4ffea,2026-01-24T21:34:00.402619,Reddit_Style,28cb794d-c388-48c6-81cf-17ac97535664,"Hey guys, has anyone tried the new feature in the Mashreq app where you get instant notifications for transactions now? I was at Carrefour the other day, and just as I was swiping my card, bam, notification popped up! It’s pretty cool, والله سرعة وراحة بال! I used to worry about potential fraud or whether my transactions were going through right away, بس الحين it feels seamless. But I’m wondering, does this affect battery life on your phone if you’re getting so many notifications? And does anyone know if this is just for specific accounts or all users? It’d be interesting to know how it technically works under the hood. Anyway, props to MashreqBank for this one—I think it's a step in the right direction. 💳🚀",f807fd9e-6e8e-40c7-9cb5-f9dd06dc4fe6,d1a9583b-d426-436e-8f5f-11f12f29e7e9,None,mix,"[""#Mashreq"", ""#BankingTech"", ""#UAE""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Positive_Neutral,0.92,False,41
