db5d94bd-c851-4666-803f-2f71ddfe1ce7,2026-01-24T21:15:36.347742,LinkedIn_Style,d7c5e04e-5d0b-411c-84e6-ddad934746bf,الصراحة اليوم واجهتني مشكلة مع Mashreq، ما قدرت ادخل على حسابي طوال الصباح. توقعت إن الأمور بتنحل بسرعة بس للاسف، حتى الآن ما في أي استجابة. هالشي ذكرني بأهمية الاستثمار في التكنولوجيا المناوبة لزيادة المرونة والابتكار، وخصوصًا إن عملاءنا يعتمدون بشكل كبير على البنوك الرقمية في كل تفاصيل حياتهم المالية. لليوم ما عندي حل، بس أتمنى @MashreqBank يتواصلون معنا بسرعة، والموقف يكون درس لنا جميعًا في كيفية تحسين خدمة العملاء في هذه الأوقات.,,db5d94bd-c851-4666-803f-2f71ddfe1ce7,None,ar,"[""#Mashreq"", ""#\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0627\u062a_\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0646\u0648\u0643"", ""#\u0627\u0644\u0631\u0642\u0645\u0646\u0629""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Service_Outage,-0.2,False,30
c3bd6d43-1dbc-4c4b-a8b9-1b9adf3fad65,2026-01-24T21:15:14.018454,Reddit_Style,e7e93d25-77f6-441e-8318-bb757e4068e3,"Hey everyone, just wanted to see if anyone else has been receiving dodgy SMS messages claiming to be from MashreqBank? Got one today saying my account is locked and to click a link to verify. Spidey sense is tingling, especially since the message didn't come from their usual number. How do these scammers even know I bank with Mashreq? 🤔 It's weird how they seem to know who's banking where. Is it possible that there's some data breach at the bank, or just a coincidence? I haven't heard anything official from Mashreq, but stay alert and double-check everything. Has anyone contacted @MashreqBank about this? Curious to see if there's an official statement or if this is just another phishing attempt. Let’s keep our money safe, folks! Share your experiences here if you've had similar issues. #StaySafe #PhishingAlert",,c3bd6d43-1dbc-4c4b-a8b9-1b9adf3fad65,Image,en,"[""StaySafe"", ""PhishingAlert""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.35,False,79
