ad9e9571-ffa0-44a9-9c1e-748ac7d4a250,2026-01-24T12:43:21.170376,Reddit_Style,fcfeb0b5-5783-45d1-a5ab-91c87148a96a,"Have you guys checked out the new features on Mashreq's app recently? I've been using their ""Spending Tracker"" and it's actually been a game-changer for budgeting. I know, I know, who even budgets anymore, right? 😂 But seriously, being able to categorize expenses right from the app and getting weekly insights is helping me save a bit more each month. Plus, the new real-time FX rates are super helpful for those of us dealing with multiple currencies. No more guessing games when I'm transferring Dirhams to Euros for trips or family back home. 

