0794b87d-4872-4c0c-99c7-efaf88459d9f,2026-01-24T11:14:32.832474,LinkedIn_Style,3850790e-ee22-42f6-ad06-b0d3da41d44d,"Yesterday, I had a rather eye-opening experience that I feel compelled to share with everyone, especially those involved in the digital banking sector. I received a call supposedly from Mashreq claiming there had been suspicious activity on my account. The caller was very convincing, but my gut told me something was off. Thankfully, I didn't share any information with them. It turns out this was a phishing attempt - scary to think how advanced these scams are becoming.

