4bf19b89-13b5-4e53-81c4-a18c301b779f,2026-01-24T08:31:21.881751,LinkedIn_Style,fa9c2fff-1bbf-4985-89c7-e360f8e7b84a,"Today, I nearly fell victim to a sophisticated scam. I received a call from someone claiming to be from @MashreqBank, asking me to confirm account details. While their language seemed professional and convincing, there were subtle red flags - poor call quality and oddly specific questions. As professionals, it's crucial to always verify the identity of any caller, especially when it concerns sensitive financial information. Mashreq will never ask for your PIN or password over the phone. Let's be vigilant. These incidents remind us all about the importance of digital banking security and the constant evolution of scammers' techniques. Always remember: when in doubt, hang up and call the bank directly using official numbers. Stay safe, everyone! #BankingFraud #DigitalSecurity",,4bf19b89-13b5-4e53-81c4-a18c301b779f,None,en,"[""#BankingFraud"", ""#DigitalSecurity""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.78,False,83
