4ce51250-f00e-4ef8-8c25-326b3075eeda,2026-01-24T07:53:18.744592,LinkedIn_Style,e304c256-bb3b-4928-9753-7967dcc553ba,"Today, I almost fell victim to an SMS phishing attempt targeting Mashreq customers. It's shocking how convincing these scams are becoming. I received a message that appeared to be from @MashreqBank, claiming urgent account issues and asking me to click a link. Thankfully, my experience in digital banking warned me not to trust unsolicited requests for personal information. 

