893a6020-df17-4518-bae0-efa6e1ab12a7,2026-01-21T12:26:59.327693,LinkedIn_Style,4b94028e-8e4c-4a9f-b33d-bb2daac134ad,"Today, I almost fell victim to a social engineering scam, something that truly shook my confidence in digital security. I received a call from someone claiming to be from Mashreq, and they were incredibly convincing. They had access to details that only my bank should know, which is alarming. It served as a stark reminder that even in today's tech-savvy world, we must remain vigilant. These fraudsters employ sophisticated tactics to extract sensitive information. Remember, @MashreqBank or any legitimate bank will never ask for your full password or PIN over the phone. If you receive a call like this, hang up immediately and contact your bank directly using official channels. Let's be proactive and safeguard our financial wellbeing. Stay safe and informed!",51cbd592-6ce3-48b3-9126-d5f9b4bd85f7,d2b4d7fd-8aac-4866-9a6d-de89677a5a23,None,en,"[""#BankingSecurity"", ""#StaySafe"", ""#Mashreq""]","[""@MashreqBank""]",Fraud_Rumor,-0.77,False,65
